  "prefLabel": "Pda 602.01 Pier Use Permit Required at Business-Use Piers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 602.01 Pier Use Permit Required at Business-Use Piers. No person shall secure a vessel to a business-use pier unless a pier use permit has been issued by the division under Pda 600, except as provided in Pda 603.02(f).\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05, ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13; ); ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
